{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fling, fail, and laugh your way to the top in </strong><strong><i>Fling &quot;Friends&quot;</i></strong><strong>\u00a0- a 3D co-op physics platformer 2-4 Players where one bad Fling drags everyone down!</strong> You and up to Four friends are tied together by a single Magic rope, climbing a massive Evil Tower full of traps, puzzles, and pure rope-fueled chaos. Every fling can save the team\u2026 or yeet everyone into disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/b4279fa8903d256e7259dbd10ea09ceb.poster.avif?t=1768403897\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/b4279fa8903d256e7259dbd10ea09ceb.webm?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/b4279fa8903d256e7259dbd10ea09ceb.mp4?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap and climb through a massive connected world filled with traps, hazards, and moving puzzles. Master physics-based movement, momentum, and rope tension to conquer impossible climbs. Each new height brings tougher challenges and bigger laughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/81e94d5bde8ef6542a46bde2b2c21ee5.poster.avif?t=1768403897\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/81e94d5bde8ef6542a46bde2b2c21ee5.webm?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/81e94d5bde8ef6542a46bde2b2c21ee5.mp4?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rope to pull your teammates from the edge, or send them flying by mistake. Master precision throws and daring rescues as you balance chaos with coordination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/16b6132423d9f0b9603a8aad2a7c2b6d.poster.avif?t=1768403897\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/16b6132423d9f0b9603a8aad2a7c2b6d.webm?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/16b6132423d9f0b9603a8aad2a7c2b6d.mp4?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player\u2019s color defines their path. Cyan and Pink must coordinate to activate color-locked buttons, platforms, and doors. No one can progress alone, success demands communication, precision, and perfectly timed flings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986580?t=1768403897","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986580?t=1768403897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/5dbf785000f837f3cb40fac5fec7be8111239892/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768403897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/5dbf785000f837f3cb40fac5fec7be8111239892/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768403897","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fling, fail, and laugh your way to the top in </strong><strong><i>Fling &quot;Friends&quot;</i></strong><strong>\u00a0- a 3D co-op physics platformer 2-4 Players where one bad Fling drags everyone down!</strong> You and up to Four friends are tied together by a single Magic rope, climbing a massive Evil Tower full of traps, puzzles, and pure rope-fueled chaos. Every fling can save the team\u2026 or yeet everyone into disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/b4279fa8903d256e7259dbd10ea09ceb.poster.avif?t=1768403897\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/b4279fa8903d256e7259dbd10ea09ceb.webm?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/b4279fa8903d256e7259dbd10ea09ceb.mp4?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap and climb through a massive connected world filled with traps, hazards, and moving puzzles. Master physics-based movement, momentum, and rope tension to conquer impossible climbs. Each new height brings tougher challenges and bigger laughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/81e94d5bde8ef6542a46bde2b2c21ee5.poster.avif?t=1768403897\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/81e94d5bde8ef6542a46bde2b2c21ee5.webm?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/81e94d5bde8ef6542a46bde2b2c21ee5.mp4?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rope to pull your teammates from the edge, or send them flying by mistake. Master precision throws and daring rescues as you balance chaos with coordination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/16b6132423d9f0b9603a8aad2a7c2b6d.poster.avif?t=1768403897\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/16b6132423d9f0b9603a8aad2a7c2b6d.webm?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/16b6132423d9f0b9603a8aad2a7c2b6d.mp4?t=1768403897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player\u2019s color defines their path. Cyan and Pink must coordinate to activate color-locked buttons, platforms, and doors. No one can progress alone, success demands communication, precision, and perfectly timed flings.</p>","developers":["OFF BOX Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/f6d593f2d562c0fe5459ca2eae00df0258ed7a0b/header.jpg?t=1768403897","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986580/1807487669/e8d3c2836af383fd688bc2fa2bb6e272f3e98203/1762280813/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762281987